<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170655150800" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Nggunakake Variabel lan Simbol Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id1170655151082">Upamane taun iki umur Greg 20 taun lan umur Alex 23 taun. Alex luwih tuwa 3 taun tinimbang Greg. Nalika umur Greg 12 taun, umur Alex 15 taun. Nalika umur Greg 35 taun, umur Alex bakal 38 taun. Pira wae umure Greg, Alex mesthi luwih tuwa 3 taun. Ing basa aljabar, umur Greg lan umur Alex diarani <term id="term-00001">variabel</term><emphasis effect="bold" />, dene 3 yaiku <term id="term-00002">konstanta</term>. Umur loro-lorone owah-owah, nanging selisih 3 taun ing antarane loro-lorone tansah tetep. Amarga selisih umur Greg lan Alex mesthi 3 taun, 3 yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">konstanta</emphasis>.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655059811">Ing aljabar, aksara alfabet digunakake kanggo makili variabel. Mula, yen umur Greg ditulis nganggo <emphasis effect="italics">g</emphasis>, bisa digunakake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kanggo makili umur Alex. Delengen <link target-id="fs-id1170654967711" />.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170654967711" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni limang larik lan rong kolom. Larik kapisan ngemot irah-irahan saben kolom. Kolom kapisan diwenehi label &quot;Umur Greg&quot; lan kolom kapindho &quot;Umur Alex&quot;. Ing kolom &quot;Umur Greg&quot; ana nilai 12, 20, 35, lan g. Ing kolom &quot;Umur Alex&quot; ana nilai 15, 23, 38, lan ekspresi g + 3.">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top">Umur Greg</entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top">Umur Alex</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>23</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>35</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>38</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mtext mathvariant="bold-italic">g</m:mtext></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext mathvariant="bold-italic">g</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="fs-id1170655195814">Aksara sing digunakake kanggo makili umur sing owah-owah iki diarani <emphasis effect="italics">variabel</emphasis>. Aksara sing paling kerep digunakake minangka variabel yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis>, lan <emphasis effect="italics">c</emphasis>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170654997446">
<title>Variabel</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655128406"><term id="term-00003">Variabel</term> yaiku aksara sing makili sawijining wilangan sing nilaine bisa owah.</para>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655160769">
<title>Konstanta</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655189845"><term id="term-00004">Konstanta</term> yaiku wilangan sing nilaine tansah tetep.</para>
</note>
</section>
